<p class="MsoNormal">Hi Ruben,<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">We're looking forward to meeting you. Here are the details for your in-person interview for the <b>Assistant Project Manager</b> position:<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<table class="MsoNormalTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:none">
<tr>
<td width="160" valign="top" style="width:120.0pt;border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;background:#F2F2F2;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal"><b>Date</b></p></td>
<td width="420" valign="top" style="width:315.0pt;border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal">Tuesday, March 10, 2026</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;background:#F2F2F2;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal"><b>Time</b></p></td>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal">10:00 AM &#8211; 11:30 AM (Pacific)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;background:#F2F2F2;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal"><b>Location</b></p></td>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal">Golden State Builders<br>1800 Von Karman Ave, Suite 400<br>Irvine, CA 92612</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;background:#F2F2F2;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal"><b>Parking</b></p></td>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal">Visitor parking, Structure B. Bring your ticket to the front desk for validation.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;background:#F2F2F2;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal"><b>Interviewers</b></p></td>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal">Dana Whitfield (Talent Acquisition Partner)<br>Mike Castellano (Senior Project Manager)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;background:#F2F2F2;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal"><b>Please bring</b></p></td>
<td valign="top" style="border:solid #BFBFBF 1.0pt;padding:4.0pt 6.0pt"><p class="MsoNormal">Photo ID, a printed copy of your resume, and any schedules, RFI logs or submittal samples you're comfortable sharing.</p></td>
</tr>
</table>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a href="https://www.goldenstatebuilders.example/calendar/interview-2026-03-10-1000.ics">Add to calendar (.ics)</a><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal">Plan on about 90 minutes: a conversation with Dana and Mike, then a short walk-through of a live project schedule. If you need to reschedule, reply to this email or call Dana at (949) 555-0170.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>
